1148:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1149:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
1150:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT control block in a <Down> buffer.
1151:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1152:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
1153:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
1154:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
1155:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\PRAETE~1\AppData\Local\Temp\ccgoOOhI.s 			page 50


1156:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1157:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
1158:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Down"-buffer.
1159:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1160:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
1161:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) Data is stored according to buffer flags.
1162:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
1163:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Additional information
1164:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function must not be called when J-Link might also do RTT.
1165:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    This function locks against all other RTT operations. I.e. during
1166:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    the write operation, writing from the application is also locked.
1167:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    If only one consumer writes to the down buffer,
1168:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    call SEGGER_RTT_WriteDownBufferNoLock() instead.
1169:./segger-rtt/src/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
